            <ArticleTitle>[Nourishing-yin effect and mechanism of different parts of Cornu Elaphuri Davidiani in rats].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>509-11</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText Label="OBJECTIVE" NlmCategory="OBJECTIVE">To investigate nourishing-yin effect and mechanism of different parts of Cornu Elaphuri Davidiani in rats.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="METHOD" NlmCategory="METHODS">The model of yin asthenia rats was built by thy roxine. The substance metabolism, pain threshold, hormone levels and biochemical indicators in serum were measured.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="RESULTS" NlmCategory="RESULTS">The ethanol extract of Cornu Elaphuri Davidiani could regulate the substance metabolism and raise the pain threshold in yin asthenia model rats. Furthermore, it could regulate the hormone levels, biochemical indicators in serum and it could improvte the antioxidant ability.</AbstractText>
                <AbstractText Label="CONCLUSION" NlmCategory="CONCLUSIONS">The ethanol extract of Cornu Elaphuri Davidiani showed significant nourishing-yin effect in rats and the possible mechanism is correlated with regulating the neuroendocrine network.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
